Migration complete and verified.

## Why it failed

The plugin declared `inject = ["apiProxy"]` and called `await ctx.apiProxy.llm.providers()`. `apiProxy` was the host-side gateway service provided by the legacy `@deepseek-ai/dsh-host-apiproxy@0.0.1-rc.1` package. In dsh 0.1.2-alpha.2 that service is gone — a content search for `apiProxy` across the entire installed dsh tree returns no matches — so the plugin's fiber stayed `pending` forever and the boot audit aborted the tree:

```
Error: dsh: plugin tree failed to load: dsh: 1 entry did not activate
@demo/dsh-upgrade-demo: pending (waiting for service: apiProxy)
```

## The migration (edited in `/app/fixture/`)

- **`index.js`** — `inject: ["apiproxy"]` → `["llm"]`; `await ctx.apiProxy.llm.providers()` → `ctx.llm.listProviders()`. The new method lives on the `LlmRuntime` service (`@deepseek-ai/dsh-llm`, already part of `dsh-base`) and is a **synchronous** `@Remote` method returning `LlmProviderInfo[]`, so the async wrapper was dropped.
- **`package.json`** — removed the dead `@deepseek-ai/dsh-host-apiproxy` dependency.
- `cordis.patch.yml` needed no change (`insert` with `id`/`name` is still the contract).

## Verification (isolated `DSH_HOME` under `/tmp`)

| Check | Result |
|---|---|
| Legacy plugin, canonical keyless probe (`dsh --profile probe ping`, dead endpoint) | exit 1, pending `apiProxy` |
| Migrated plugin, same probe | tree activated, `llm.listProviders() 成功 → 路由数 0 []`, boot reached the model call (`TRANSPORT` line) |
| `dsh plugin add` of a packed tarball, fresh profile | bundle reconciled, real `node_modules` install, reached model call |
| Headless full boot without credential | no tree failure; only expected `MISSING_CREDENTIAL` from the agent layer |

Route count `0` is expected on a keyless host — the catalog call itself succeeds (adapters register on their own apply, observable via `llm/adapters-updated`).

The migration report and raw evidence logs are under `/app/agent-output/M1-host-migration/` (`report.md` plus `evidence/legacy-probe.log`, `evidence/migrated-probe.log`, `evidence/packed-tarball-install.log`).

